## 3. KANBAN STYLE VIEW - ADMIN DASHBOARD

### Overview
The Admin Dashboard currently displays tickets in a list view with filtering and search capabilities. While a full kanban board is not yet implemented in the current codebase, the admin dashboard has a well-structured foundation with:
- Status-based filtering (Pending, In Progress, Resolved)
- Priority filtering (High, Medium, Low)
- Search functionality
- Statistics cards showing counts by status

### Files Involved:
- `src/pages/AdminDashboard.jsx` - Main admin dashboard implementation

