## Summary of Contributions

### 1. Notification System
- **Bell icon** displayed in the navigation bar for non-admin users
- **Badge counter** showing number of unread notifications (capped at 9+)
- **Notification dropdown panel** with title, message, and timestamp
- **Clear All button** to remove all notifications at once
- **Automatic trigger** when students create new tickets

### 2. My Tickets Feature
- **Toggle buttons** to switch between "My Tickets" and "View All Tickets"
- **Student-specific filtering** that shows only tickets created by the logged-in student
- **Responsive display** with conditional messaging
- **Navigation link** labeled "My Tickets" in the header for quick access

### 3. Admin Dashboard (List View)
- **Status-based statistics** cards showing counts for Pending, In Progress, and Resolved tickets
- **Advanced filtering** by status, priority, and search query
- **Ticket list display** with clickable cards for detailed view
- **Status update modal** for changing ticket status and adding comments

All features are fully functional and integrated into the application workflow.
